{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weird abstract puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389980/extras/bandicam2024-12-2713-05-04-518-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745463149\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 well-designed levels that will make you think. Takes around 40 minutes to beat it to the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your own levels using the\u00a0<strong>Level Editor!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share your creations with all your friends in form of\u00a0<strong>PNG images</strong>.\u00a0<i>(levels are encoded in PNGs that you can re-import into the game later)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Browse countless user-generated levels to <strong>PLAY</strong> on the Discord Server!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frequent updates with new content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack brimming with personality... and darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Created by one person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-Game timer to speedrun levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389980/extras/gjgdgdjdgjdg.png?t=1745463149\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">(The game also includes +30 custom levels to play offline, available where the game is installed.)</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3389980?t=1745463149","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3389980?t=1745463149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389980/5ac